          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We apply the power of product rule and then simplify:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: (2x)^{3}|=; (2)^{3} \u22c5 (x)^{3}|=; (8) \u22c5 (x^{3})|=; 8x^{3}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We apply the power of product rule and then simplify:\n[MATH: (2x)^{3}|=; (2)^{3} \u22c5 (x)^{3}|=; (8) \u22c5 (x^{3})|=; 8x^{3}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
