          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We apply the power of product rule and then simplify:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (2x^{2}y^{\u2212 1})^{\u2212 4}|=; 2^{\u2212 4} \u22c5 (x^{2})^{\u2212 4} \u22c5 (y^{\u2212 1})^{\u2212 4}|=; (1)/(2^{4}) \u22c5 x^{(2)(\u2212 4)} \u22c5 y^{(\u2212 1)(\u2212 4)}|=; (1)/(16) \u22c5 x^{\u2212 8} \u22c5 y^{4}|=; (1)/(16) \u22c5 (1)/(x^{8}) \u22c5 y^{4}|=; (y^{4})/(16x^{8})]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We apply the power of product rule and then simplify:\n\n[MATH: (2x^{2}y^{\u2212 1})^{\u2212 4}|=; 2^{\u2212 4} \u22c5 (x^{2})^{\u2212 4} \u22c5 (y^{\u2212 1})^{\u2212 4}|=; (1)/(2^{4}) \u22c5 x^{(2)(\u2212 4)} \u22c5 y^{(\u2212 1)(\u2212 4)}|=; (1)/(16) \u22c5 x^{\u2212 8} \u22c5 y^{4}|=; (1)/(16) \u22c5 (1)/(x^{8}) \u22c5 y^{4}|=; (y^{4})/(16x^{8})]",
